"Texto Ajuda" = "The \"Menstrual Period Calendar\" is a method used to forecast the fertile and infertile women’s period. Through this calendar it is possible to estimate the most possible dates of getting pregnant in case of sexual relations.

However, opposite of what most people thinks, the “menstrual period calendar” shall not be used as a contraceptive method, but it is a great tool for the ones looking for pregnancy. Nevertheless, the method for getting pregnant by using the “menstrual period calendar” is still very confusing for most women.

The method indicates, using estimated calculations, the most possible date for ovulation and the most or less propitious for rendering, based on the date of the last ovulation date and the quantity of days of the menstrual cycle.

Usually the ovulation happens in the middle of the menstrual cycle. Thus, for example, in a 28 days cycle, the ovulation will happen between the 12th or 15th day counting from the first day of the last menstrual cycle. Due to possible variations in ovulation, as well as the sperm lifetime, the fertile period is considered between 2 days before and 2 days after the most possible day, totalizing 5 days.

In some situations, where the cycle is not regular, the “menstrual period calendar” must not be used.
Such as the cases of:
• Teenagers, in which a regular cycle is rare.
• Women with irregular cycle.
• Women with hormonal, emotional or even feeding alterations

Then, it is clear that the “menstrual period calendar” is not a reliable contraceptive method. Besides that, there are cases in which women get pregnant in their infertile period, even during the menstruation period.

It is important to keep in mind that this method does not avoid AIDS or any other STD.";

"Texto Acordo" = "The \"Menstrual Period Calendar\" shall not be used as a contraceptive method. The ovulation period is different for every women, besides that there are a lot of other factors that may change the cycle lasting, such as anxiety, stress, diseases and others.

So, the method is recommended to the woman who intends to get pregnant, not for the ones who are avoiding pregnancy. Besides that, its calculation is just estimation.";

"De Acordo" = "I’m aware of it";